<title>USA: Great Southern Bancorp Inc Q2 net climbs.</title>
<headline>Great Southern Bancorp Inc Q2 net climbs.</headline>
<dateline>SPRINGFIELD, Mo. 1997-01-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Three months ended	Three months ended</p>
<p>			   December 31		December 31</p>
<p>				1996			1995</p>
<p> Shr			  $0.34		    $0.27</p>
<p> Net			 $2,908		   $2,478</p>
<p>			 Six months ended	 Six months ended</p>
<p>			   December 31		December 31</p>
<p> Shr			  $0.38		    $0.58</p>
<p> Net			 $3,401		   $5,363</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>Note: Total assets on December 31, 1996, were $669,482, compared to $658,834 as of December 31, 1995. Loans receivable on December 31, 1996, $565,377, versus $544,200 one year ago. Deposits as of December 31, 1996, were $379,488, compared with $388,429.</p>
<p>((Chicago newsdesk (312) 408-8787))</p>
